<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Weekly Opsway Report</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
        <h2>Weekly Opsway Report: {{.TeamName}}</h2>
        <p>Here is your weekly summary for the period of <strong>{{.StartDate}}</strong> to <strong>{{.EndDate}}</strong>.</p>
        
        <h3>Overview</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Total Monitors:</strong> {{.TotalMonitors}}</li>
            <li><strong>Monitors Currently Up:</strong> {{.MonitorsUp}}</li>
            <li><strong>Monitors Currently Down:</strong> {{.MonitorsDown}}</li>
            <li><strong>Average Uptime:</strong> {{.AverageUptime}}%</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Incident Activity</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Total Incidents:</strong> {{.TotalIncidents}}</li>
            <li><strong>Resolved Incidents:</strong> {{.ResolvedIncidents}}</li>
        </ul>

        <a href="{{.DashboardURL}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; color: #fff; background-color: #007bff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">Go to Dashboard</a>
        <br>
        <br>
        <p>Thanks,<br>The Opsway Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
